        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那好多减肥的人呢，因为减肥。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.383,
      "end": 9.383,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "所以他就要控糖，所以呢，无糖的碳酸饮料呢，",
      "score": 0.07,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0281,
        "sc_logprob": -0.035,
        "sc_delta": -0.0069,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.037,
        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "所以它就要空糖。所以呢，无糖的碳酸饮料呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 9.383,
      "end": 13.655,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "糖就特别喜欢喝。但是这种无糖饮料喝了之后，",
      "score": 0.4246,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2114,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2338,
        "sc_delta": -0.0224,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.77,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他就特别喜欢喝。但是这种无糖饮料喝了之后。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.655,
      "end": 19.898,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "真的是不长胖没有的。其实无糖碳酸饮料并不是真的一点不含糖。",
      "score": 0.0521,
      "wav": "",
